    "text": {
     "en": "Kharif crops like rice and cotton are sown with the monsoon. Rabi crops like wheat and mustard are sown in winter.\nModern farming uses tractors, improved seeds, irrigation and fertilisers. Organic farming avoids chemicals.\nCareful use of water and soil keeps farms productive."
    }
